*-----
* A-taper potentiometer (logarithmic)
* Pins:
*  A - 0 pin
*  W - wiper
*  B - 1 pin
*
* Parameters:
*  Rtotal = total resistance
*  alpha = wiper position (0 to 1)
*  curve = steepness
*  Rmin = minimum resistance
*-----
.SUBCKT POT_A A W B PARAMS: Rtotal = 10e3 alpha = 0.5 curve = 3 Rmin = 1m

.param ratio = {(10 ** (curve * alpha) - 1) / (10 ** curve - 1)}

R1 A W {Rmin + Rtotal * ratio}
R2 W B {Rmin + Rtotal * (1 - ratio)}

* debug ratio
* Eratio 0 Nratio value={ratio}
.ENDS POT_A

*-----
* B-taper potentiometer
* Pins:
*  A - 0 pin
*  W - wiper
*  B - 1 pin
*
* Parameters:
*  Rtotal = total resistance
*  alpha = wiper position (0 to 1)
*  Rmin = minimum resistance
*-----
.SUBCKT POT_B A W B PARAMS: Rtotal = 10e3 alpha = 0.5 Rmin = 1m

.param ratio = LIMIT(alpha, 1m, 1-1m)

R1 A W {Rmin + Rtotal * ratio}
R2 W B {Rmin + Rtotal * (1 - ratio)}

.ENDS POT_B
